<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Nigerese forces rescued 16 abductees, seized 38 motorcycles, AK-47 rifles, RPGs, other weapons and ₦4.7 million while bandits killed farmer Malam Musa Dogo and his son Uzaifa in Niger. Militants and vigilantes engaged over 100 suspected terrorists in Mariga forest and armed men advanced toward vulnerable Miango communities. Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were observed operating in Mali and the EU expressed concern about Algerian and Russian forces in Niger, while Russia helped foil a coup in Niger. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNT3QzLVVXS2JKeFFvMHFIUHIyeFNLTk5MRm5SOTZncmlfaDYyaW1tdTUyV3FGZ3JlNEZRdHZ2bWpoVXlGQ3JUb3BlS0FsTjBQZWl3WmdBbUxQQXREOHp4Z1NSOEVqWFBkbU0xRVhGSDVzMzFkZWhHQTJfZmc4Q1VyTVFoaFhXUHBHV0dQbEh6cnRpRnlzZENYbzhOWGVNSjY5YTZZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;24 Канал&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQcEtsRUZhQ0hMU0NkbC1sZXNBY3lYUFhXSzM2d1B3UllOaHNkUGJPSUE1QnB5Vmc1by12WklSYk5aN2t0NjZiTnhjUWFKb0RzUnR3NUlSVmk1cGIwWFhJd1Y4ME96UUR1UnM3UDlmYms2X0laV0E0ZlNTcUt3bndEOVpRTURwMjFGTElRc2VaRTUwUU5XQmdVejFYaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxONndPeTdZM21YdmowN0czWGNmanJIZ0JkUVd4ZUI5UXB3UWJGZTl6bkg3Y0RNZFdNSmw0RTRFRlJSM2x0T0t3MWVRa0tmU0lUYTBEcUNjdmYwSldKMnZ2STA4NGJCV256anljN290TTVZTFRHTXJqOTRLd3dZOXE1UURSdGtVb0Q3aldKN1ctUXdrOUtjMzVvcXhqS05NTkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPeU9aY0hfWDZjbmNCYXlrMlhEekN5MGEzNnVFSlBTcTF5cU8ySURFM2JQSFJJSDNLQ19RRXdKYkh6Q2VSM1ZsNkhuS1lab1EySzJ1S3ZvOU52VWJJcXdiSEZ5cGRTYTdGVWJwdzBfQ3UwRXphM1gxMEFTa2hOUTlQNE8xcWVSN09PajZidWpLblZpRW9mTDlaeUZMamNaeUpud3RLVnZ3cHBNVDhmdTR6U3MtSUw1dzdoSXVCQ0dpVQ?o